@startuml F5.19-D02-criar-tarefa
title F5.19-D02 — Criar tarefa
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "TaskController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Salvar tarefa
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /tasks
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: INSERT PENDENTE
note right of Ctrl
  estado nunca do body;
  sem outbox
end note
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK (COMMIT)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 201 + _links
WebApp --> Sec: card em Pendentes

@enduml
